WEBVTT

00:09:57.968 --> 00:10:01.930
their wholeness and their humanity,

00:10:01.972 --> 00:10:06.268
then it would be easier for everyone
to appreciate their roles

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:09.980
and back them with the support
that they deserve.

00:10:11.357 --> 00:10:12.733
So let's act now.

00:10:13.817 --> 00:10:17.863
How about we stop thanking
mothers for being selfless

00:10:17.905 --> 00:10:20.324
and putting their needs
behind everyone else's?

00:10:20.366 --> 00:10:26.497
(Applause)

00:10:26.538 --> 00:10:27.915
And instead,

00:10:27.956 --> 00:10:30.834
we thank them for being our first leaders,